CONTEXT

Why HOS Exists

01 — Structural Gaps
Most therapy models lack a shared operating language across modalities and clinicians.

02 — No Real-Time Measurement
Progress is often retrospective. Clinicians lack live telemetry on capacity and risk.

03 — Safety Blind Spots
Without clear circuit breakers, deep work can be attempted when the system is not ready.

